cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use jimichi or its measurements, please cite it as below.
title: 'jimichi: confidential messaging with metadata protection and a traffic correlation testbed'
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Igor
    family-names: Iurtaev
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/jimichi-org/jimichi
url: https://jimichi.org
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23001699
abstract: >-
  A confidential messaging system that sends messages through a chain of three relays under nested
  encryption, with fixed-size cells and session keys held only in locked memory, together with a
  traffic correlation attack that measures how much timings and volumes still reveal and what it
  costs to take that away.
keywords:
  - metadata privacy
  - traffic analysis
  - onion routing
  - cryptography
  - GOST
